@startuml F5.6-D01-busca-alunos
title F5.6-D01 — Busca de alunos
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Buscar "João"
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /academico/alunos?q=
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT trgm / GRR / email
note right of Ctrl
  sem filtro curso na busca;
  _links só se curso no escopo
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Sec: tabela HATEOAS

@enduml
